<title>USA: Albertson's says May same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Albertson's says May same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		  n/a	  n/a	 +6.4	  +0.1</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended	  May 29.</p>
<p>Full company name is</p>
<p>During the second quarter of 1996, the company's Denver Division benefited from a strike that affected two of the company's competitors.  Excluding the Denver Division, for the four weeks ended May 29, 1997, total sales increased 9.1% and comparable store sales increased 2.3%.</p>
</text>
